msgid ""
"**Beta Disk** is the TR-DOS disk interface; the **+3** has its own drives"
" and +3DOS (see [Floppy disks](disks.md))."
msgstr ""
"**Beta Disk** es la interfaz de disco de TR-DOS; el **+3** tiene sus "
"propias unidades y +3DOS (consulta [Disquetes](disks.md))."

msgid ""
"On the clones and the +3 the disk interface is part of the board, and so "
"are the hard disk interfaces of the ATM Turbo 2+, the Profi v5 and the ZX"
" Evolution: Options shows them, but does not let you remove them."
msgstr ""
"En los clones y en el +3, la interfaz de disco forma parte de la placa, "
"igual que las interfaces de disco duro del ATM Turbo 2+, el Profi v5 y el"
" ZX Evolution: Options las muestra, pero no te deja quitarlas."

msgid ""
